{"height": 4, "weight": 33, "base_experience": 55, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-attack", "value": 1}], "genus": "Cherry Pokémon", "capture_rate": 190, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["fairy", "plant"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "チェリンボ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Cherinbo"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "체리버"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "櫻花寶"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Ceribou"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Kikugi"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Cherubi"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Cherubi"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "チェリンボ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "樱花宝"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Cherubi"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["diamond"], "text": "The small ball holds the nutrients needed for evolution. Apparently, it is very sweet and tasty."}, {"versions": ["pearl", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution."}, {"versions": ["platinum"], "text": "The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. STARLY try to peck it off."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."}, {"versions": ["black", "white", "black-2", "white-2"], "text": "The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "It nimbly dashes about to avoid getting pecked by bird Pokémon that would love to make off with its small, nutrient-rich storage ball."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "The deeper a Cherubi’s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!"}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Once the fruit growing alongside the main body is large and plump, Cherubi will use the nutrients within to evolve. The fruit then